From 936ee774a9872c2a52a69d34e74bd334ca422a14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam Cipoletti <adam@amcreativecoach.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:43:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 29/46] Leave WebCoreView.m out again

With it, mobile Wikipedia never finished loading. Without it, WebKit
logs and discards an unrecognized-selector exception on some focus
changes, as Leopard WebKit builds from this CMake setup did before.
---
 Source/WebCore/PlatformMac.cmake | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Source/WebCore/PlatformMac.cmake b/Source/WebCore/PlatformMac.cmake
index b8061204..1c93e29d 100644
--- a/Source/WebCore/PlatformMac.cmake
+++ b/Source/WebCore/PlatformMac.cmake
@@ -549,7 +549,6 @@ list(APPEND WebCore_SOURCES
     platform/mac/DragDataMac.mm
     platform/mac/DragImageMac.mm
     platform/mac/EventLoopMac.mm
-    platform/mac/WebCoreView.m
     platform/mac/FileSystemMac.mm
     platform/mac/KeyEventMac.mm
     platform/mac/LocalCurrentGraphicsContext.mm
-- 
